[2026-03-15T09:24:56.732Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ChBVB1ZWLt9LnwiSjpGAiV","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile a complete summary.\n\n## Complete Codebase Analysis: Trips, Tracked Routes, and TrackedRouteCard\n\nI've thoroughly explored the codebase and found all the relevant files. Here's the complete information:\n\n### 1. **Trips Page Component** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx`)\n\nThe MyTripsPage is the main container component that:\n- Uses Redux to manage trips state (bookings, trackedRoutes, loading states, activeTab)\n- Fetches bookings and tracked routes on mount using `fetchMyBookings()` and `fetchTrackedRoutes()` async thunks\n- Implements session token management with localStorage (key: `gf_session_token`)\n- Renders the `TripsTabs` component to switch between 'upcoming', 'past', and 'tracked' tabs\n- For the 'tracked' tab, it renders a list of TrackedRouteCard components with untrack callbacks\n- Uses data-testid: `my-trips-page`, `trips-loading`, `trips-tracked-list`\n\n### 2. **TripsTabs Component** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`)\n\nThe tabs navigation component that:\n- Displays three tabs: 'upcoming', 'past', 'tracked'\n- Uses Redux `setActiveTab()` action to update the active tab\n- Each tab button has data-testid: `trips-tab-{key}` (e.g., `trips-tab-tracked`)\n- Styled with CSS classes from TripsTabs.css\n\n### 3. **TrackedRouteCard Component** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TrackedRouteCard.tsx`)\n\nThe component that displays each tracked route with:\n\n**Props:**\n```typescript\ninterface TrackedRouteCardProps {\n  route: TrackedRoute\n  onUntrack: (routeId: string) => void\n  isUntracking: boolean\n}\n```\n\n**Features:**\n- Shows origin/destination codes and city names\n- Displays date range (departure_date_start to departure_date_end)\n- Shows lowest current price in the cabin class\n- Displays price trend percentage (↑ for increase in red, ↓ for decrease in green)\n- Has Search button to navigate to `/results` with query params\n- Has Untrack button to remove route tracking\n\n**Data-testid attributes:**\n- `tracked-route-card-{routeId}` - Main card container\n- `tracked-route-route-{routeId}` - Route text (e.g., \"LAX → LHR\")\n- `tracked-route-dates-{routeId}` - Date range display\n- `tracked-route-price-{routeId}` - Price information container\n- `tracked-route-trend-{routeId}` - Price trend indicator\n- `tracked-route-search-{routeId}` - Search button\n- `tracked-route-untrack-{routeId}` - Untrack button\n\n### 4. **Redux Slice** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/tripsSlice.ts`)\n\n**State shape:**\n```typescript\ninterface TripsState {\n  bookings: BookingTrip[]\n  trackedRoutes: TrackedRoute[]\n  loading: boolean\n  trackedLoading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n  activeTab: TripsTab // 'upcoming' | 'past' | 'tracked'\n  cancellingBookingId: string | null\n  cancelError: string | null\n  untrackingRouteId: string | null\n}\n```\n\n**TrackedRoute interface:**\n```typescript\ninterface TrackedRoute {\n  id: string\n  departure_date_start: string | null\n  departure_date_end: string | null\n  cabin_class: string\n  created_at: string\n  origin_code: string\n  origin_city: string\n  dest_code: string\n  dest_city: string\n  lowest_price_cents: number | null\n  price_trend_percent: number | null\n}\n```\n\n**Async thunks:**\n- `fetchTrackedRoutes(sessionToken)` - GET `/api/tracked-routes?session={sessionToken}`\n- `untrackRoute({ routeId, sessionToken })` - DELETE `/api/tracked-routes` with body\n\n### 5. **Backend: Tracked Routes API** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/tracked-routes.ts`)\n\n**GET /api/tracked-routes**\n- Query params: `session`, `origin` (optional), `destination` (optional)\n- If origin and destination specified: checks if route is already tracked\n- Otherwise: fetches all tracked routes for the session with:\n  - Current lowest price from flights in that cabin class\n  - Price trend calculation: `(lowest - initial) / initial * 100`\n- Returns array of tracked routes enriched with price_trend_percent\n\n**POST /api/tracked-routes**\n- Creates new tracked route\n- Body: `{ sessionToken, originCode, destCode, departureDateStart?, departureDateEnd?, cabinClass? }`\n- Finds or creates session\n- Looks up airport IDs from codes\n- Captures initial price at tracking time\n- Inserts into tracked_routes table with initial_price_cents\n\n**DELETE /api/tracked-routes**\n- Body: `{ sessionToken, id? } | { sessionToken, originCode, destCode }`\n- Can delete by route ID or by origin/destination pair\n- Only deletes if session matches\n\n### 6. **Backend: My Bookings API** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/my-bookings.ts`)\n\n**GET /api/my-bookings**\n- Fetches bookings for a session\n- Joins with flights, airlines, and airports for complete trip info\n\n**PATCH /api/my-bookings**\n- Updates booking status (only supports 'cancelled')\n- Body: `{ bookingId, sessionToken, status: 'cancelled' }`\n\n### 7. **Seed Data** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts`)\n\n**Key seeded tracked routes (session token: `seed-session-token`):**\n\n1. **LAX → LHR** (2026-04-01 to 2026-04-15, economy)\n   - initial_price_cents: 61504\n   - current lowest: 68885 (AA800 flight)\n   - trend: +12% (price increased)\n\n2. **SFO → NRT** (2026-04-10 to 2026-04-25, economy)\n   - initial_price_cents: 93625\n   - current lowest: 86135 (UA800 flight)\n   - trend: -8% (price decreased)\n\n3. **JFK → CDG** (2026-05-01 to 2026-05-15, economy)\n   - initial_price_cents: 57385\n   - current lowest: 57385 (AF100 flight)\n   - trend: 0% (no change)\n\n**How to use seed data:**\n- Set `localStorage.setItem('gf_session_token', 'seed-session-token')`\n- Navigate to `/trips`\n- The tracked routes for this session are pre-populated\n\n### 8. **Test File** (`/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/tracked-route-card.spec.ts`)\n\nContains comprehensive Playwright tests covering:\n- Route display (origin → destination)\n- Date range display\n- Price display\n- Price trend indicators (up/down)\n- Search button navigation with query parameters\n- Untrack button functionality\n- Multiple card interactions\n\n---\n\n## File Summary\n\n**Key files created/read:**\n\n1. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx` - Main trips page\n2. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx` - Tab navigation\n3. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TrackedRouteCard.tsx` - Tracked route card component\n4. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/TrackedRouteCard.css` - Card styling\n5. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/tripsSlice.ts` - Redux state management\n6. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/tracked-routes.ts` - Backend API\n7. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/my-bookings.ts` - Bookings API\n8. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts` - Database seeding\n9. `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/tracked-route-card.spec.ts` - Test specs\n\nAll files have been read in their entirety above."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ab875f6f009a3b94a (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 56301\ntool_uses: 28\nduration_ms: 36617</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a7364a07-0623-40ea-bf2b-2159671725a0","uuid":"32f8def1-0ebd-408e-9311-ab208acfd1f4","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src, find all files related to \"trips\", \"tracked\", and \"TrackedRouteCard\". I need to understand:\n1. The Trips page component and how it renders tabs (especially the \"tracked\" tab)\n2. The TrackedRouteCard component\n3. Any data-testid attributes used: trips-tab-tracked, trips-tracked-list, tracked-route-card-*, tracked-route-route-*, tracked-route-dates-*, tracked-route-price-*, tracked-route-trend-*, tracked-route-search-*, tracked-route-untra